{"strongs": "H0226", "word": "אוֺת", "translit": "ot", "root": "אות", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "sign, pledge, token", "definition": "אוֺת noun masculine 79 Exod 4:8 ( feminine Josh 24:17 ) sign (Arabic , plural , Aramaic אָתָא , ) — ׳ א Gen 4:15 +; construct Gen 9:12 +; plural אוֺתוֺת Exod 4:9 + etc. — 1. sign, pledge, token Gen 4:15 ( J ); אוֺת אֱמֶת true, token Josh 2:12 ( J ); of blood of passover Exod 12:13 ( P ); אוֺת לְטוֺבָה token for good Ps 86:17 pledges, assurances of travellers Job 21:29 . 2. signs, omens promised by prophets as pledges of certain predicted events 1Sam 10:7 ; 1Sam 10:9 + v 1Sam 10:1 where ׳ א insert ᵐ5 ᵑ9 , see We Dr ; especially phrase זֶה הָאוֺת לְ Exod 3:12 ; 1Sam 2:34 ; 1Sam 14:10 ; 2Kgs 19:29 ; Jer 44:29 ; Isa 7:11 ; Isa 7:14 probably also Isa 44:25 (of false prophets). 3. sign, symbol of prophets Isa 8:18 compare Ezek 4:3 . 4. signs, miracles , as pledges or attestations of divine presence & interposition Exod 4:8 (twice in verse); Exod 4:9 ( J ) Exod 7:3 ( P ) Exod 8:19 ( J ) Ps 74:9 ; 2Kgs 19:29 ; 2Kgs 20:8 ; 2Kgs 20:9 = Isa 37:30 ; Isa 38:7 ; Isa 38:22 with עָשָׂה Exod 4:17 ; Exod 4:30 ; Num 14:11 ; Num 14:22 ; Josh 24:17 (all J E ) Deut 11:3 ; Judg 6:17 with צִוָּה Exod 4:28 ( J ); with שִׁית Exod 10:1 ( J ); with שִׂים Exod 10:2 ( J ) Ps 78:43 ; Isa 66:19 הָאוֺת וְהַמּוֺפֵת (see מוֺפֵת ) Deut 13:3 compare Deut 28:46 ; Isa 20:3 ׳ אוֺ מ ׳ א Deut 13:2 אוֺתוֺת וּמוֺפְתִים Deut 4:34 ; Deut 7:19 ; Deut 26:8 ; Deut 29:2 ; Jer 32:31 with נָתַן Deut 6:22 ; Neh 9:10 with שִׂים Jer 32:20 ; Ps 105:27 with שָׁלַח Deut 34:11 ; Ps 135:9 . 5. signs, memorials , stones from Jordan Josh 4:6 ( J ); metal of censers Num 17:3 ( P ); Aaron's rod Num 17:25 ( P ); עוֺלָם ׳ א Isa 55:13 probably also Ezek 14:8 (|| מָשָׁל ); signs on hands, etc., Exod 13:9 ; Exod 13:16 ( J ) = Deut 6:8 ; Deut 11:18 , probably belong here; also memorial pillar in Egypt Isa 19:20 . 6. sign, pledge of convenant, הַבְּרִית ׳ א (see ברית ) e.g. rainbow, of Noachian convenant Gen 9:12 ; Gen 9:13 ; Gen 9:17 ( P ); circumcision, of Abrahamic convenant Gen 17:11 ( P ); the sabbath Exod 31:13 ; Exod 31:17 ( P ); Ezek 20:12 ; Ezek 20:20 . 7. ensigns, standards Num 2:2 ( P ) Ps 74:4 . 8. signs, tokens of changes of weather & times Gen 1:14 ( P ; of heavenly luminaries) אוֺתוֺת הַשָּׁמַיִם Jer 10:2 (changes of the heavens as omens to frighten the nations) compare Ps 65:9 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB183')\">BDB183</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H226')\">H226</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB182')\">BDB182</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB184')\">BDB184</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אוֺת</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sub>79</sub> <sup><ref ref=\"Exod 4:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,4,8)\">Exod 4:8</ref></sup> (<b>feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Josh 24:17\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(6,24,17)\">Josh 24:17</ref></sup>) sign (Arabic <placeholder84/>, plural <placeholder85/>, Aramaic <bdbarc>אָתָא</bdbarc>, <placeholder86/>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 4:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,15)\">Gen 4:15</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"Gen 9:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,12)\">Gen 9:12</ref> +; plural <bdbheb>אוֺתוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 4:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,4,9)\">Exod 4:9</ref> + etc. — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>sign, pledge, token</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 4:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,15)\">Gen 4:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>אוֺת אֱמֶת</bdbheb> <highlight>true, token</highlight> <ref ref=\"Josh 2:12\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(6,2,12)\">Josh 2:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); of blood of passover <ref ref=\"Exod 12:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,13)\">Exod 12:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>אוֺת לְטוֺבָה</bdbheb> <highlight>token for good</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 86:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"86\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"86\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,86,17)\">Ps 86:17</ref> <highlight>pledges, assurances</highlight> of travellers <ref ref=\"Job 21:29\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(18,21,29)\">Job 21:29</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>signs, omens</highlight> promised by prophets as pledges of certain predicted events <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,7)\">1Sam 10:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,9)\">1Sam 10:9</ref> + v<ref ref=\"1Sam 10:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,1)\">1Sam 10:1</ref> where <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> insert <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>; especially phrase <bdbheb>זֶה הָאוֺת לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 3:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,12)\">Exod 3:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:34\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,34)\">1Sam 2:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,10)\">1Sam 14:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,29)\">2Kgs 19:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 44:29\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(24,44,29)\">Jer 44:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,11)\">Isa 7:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 7:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,7,14)\">Isa 7:14</ref> probably also <ref ref=\"Isa 44:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,25)\">Isa 44:25</ref> (of false prophets). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>sign, symbol</highlight> of prophets <ref ref=\"Isa 8:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,18)\">Isa 8:18</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 4:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,4,3)\">Ezek 4:3</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>signs, miracles</highlight>, as pledges or attestations of divine presence &amp; interposition <ref ref=\"Exod 4:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,4,8)\">Exod 4:8</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Exod 4:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,4,9)\">Exod 4:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Exod 7:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,3)\">Exod 7:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Exod 8:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,19)\">Exod 8:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Ps 74:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,9)\">Ps 74:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:29\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,29)\">2Kgs 19:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"